# No line ending normalisation anywhere.
#
# This repository vendors the whole UEAtelier Tools/ tree and Plugins/UnrealMcp/ source
# tree. Forcing eol would rewrite those third party files on every checkout and produce
# meaningless diff noise. The project is developed on Windows only, so storing and
# checking out bytes verbatim is the least surprising behaviour.

# ---- UE assets: binary, never diffed, never auto merged ----
# Asset conflicts can only be resolved by picking one side or by redoing the edit in the
# editor. Letting git attempt a three way merge just produces a corrupt .uasset.
*.uasset  binary -merge -diff
*.umap    binary -merge -diff
*.ubulk   binary -merge -diff
*.uexp    binary -merge -diff
*.uptnl   binary -merge -diff

# ---- Other binaries ----
*.fbx  binary -merge -diff
*.png  binary -diff
*.jpg  binary -diff
*.tga  binary -diff
*.wav  binary -diff
*.dll  binary -diff
*.pdb  binary -diff
*.zip  binary -diff

# To switch the assets over to Git LFS later:
#   git lfs install
#   git lfs track "*.uasset" "*.umap" "*.ubulk" "*.uexp"
# Note that every machine cloning this repository would then need git-lfs installed,
# otherwise the working copy only receives pointer files.
